      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Chestermere has its own Land Use Bylaw, and its garage limits are not Calgary's. Get two or three comparable written quotes, early, from independent builders who will draw to the right rules.</p>
